				"objectNames": [
					"尤考姆"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750070101,
					"content": "(test)唉，那家伙怎么还没回来，我要在这儿站岗站多久啊…唔，不会出什么事了吧？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750070102,
						750070106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤考姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 750070102,
					"content": "(test)你是谁？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750070103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750070103,
					"content": "(test)哈哈，我？真是个好奇心旺盛的客人，如您所见，我的名字叫尤考姆，是此处哨站的看守…之一。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750070104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤考姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 750070104,
					"content": "#(test)不过要我说，{M#兄弟}{F#小姐}，在纳塔的野外可不能像这样随便向人搭话…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750070105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤考姆"
				},
				{
					"id": 750070105,
					"content": "(test)这里已经接近回声之子部族的外沿，出了这个区域，就是战士们互相「切磋」的地界了。$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750070110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "尤考姆"
				}
			]
		},
		{
